        "text_G7eEn9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kisco’s floating candles aren’t just beautiful—they’re built to perform. Our wholesale floating candles are designed for professionals who can’t afford to compromise on quality or consistency. Each one delivers a clean burn, even float, and long-lasting glow. No waxy film. No smoky residue. Just pure, elegant light.</p><p>Perfect for large installations and small details alike, our bulk floating candles are available in a range of sizes to suit any vision. Whether you’re setting up dozens of centerpieces or illuminating a poolside display, you’ll find exactly what you need.</p><p>Looking for a larger order? Take advantage of our volume discounts and free nationwide shipping. The more you order, the more you save.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_4W4pwU",
