        "text_xD9w9e": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Event professionals rely on dependable, high-quality products—and our bulk floating candles deliver every time. From weddings to brand activations, Kisco’s wholesale floating candles help event planners bring their lighting concepts to life.<br/></p><p>They’re easy to use, mess-free, and pair effortlessly with floral designs, water features, and elegant glass vessels. Our candles float evenly and stay lit through long receptions and evening events, offering both visual impact and peace of mind.</p><p>Planning a large event? We’ll make sure your order arrives on time and in perfect condition. Plus, you can count on our support team to assist with custom quantities and special requests.</p><p>Join the thousands of planners who trust Kisco for reliable, stylish lighting.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
