        "text_8gxBHD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>You deserve candles that meet professional standards. That’s why Kisco only offers premium bulk floating candles, crafted with care from plant-based wax and cotton wicks. No harsh odors. No chemical dyes. Just clean, classic light that enhances any space.<br/>For customers who need large quantities, our wholesale floating candles<strong> </strong>program ensures you always have a steady supply without compromising quality.</p><p>These candles aren’t just for one-time use. They’re part of your brand presentation—whether you’re setting a table, styling a photoshoot, or creating an unforgettable spa atmosphere. With Kisco, you’ll get candles that reflect the same attention to detail you bring to your business.</p><p>Free shipping. Free returns. Competitive wholesale pricing. Everything you need—without compromise.</p>",
