        "text_kr9czP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Floating candles are beautiful and incredibly versatile, making them ideal for many kinds of events and settings. Because they're available at wholesale prices, they provide a cost-effective solution for creating ambiance and elegance. Here are some popular uses for our bulk floating candles:</p><ul><li><strong>Wedding Centerpieces: </strong>Create a romantic mood by setting wedding floating candles adrift in decorative bowls.</li><li> <strong>Spa Settings: </strong>Enhance the tranquility of spa treatments with the gentle light of floating candles.</li><li> <strong>Home Decor: </strong>Refine everyday living spaces with floating candles in vases or baths for a relaxing end to the day.</li><li> <strong>Special Events: </strong>From corporate dinners to holiday parties, floating candles add a sophisticated flair.</li><li><strong>Restaurants and Bars:</strong> Create intimate table settings or illuminate outdoor patios gracefully.</li></ul>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
