    "custom_liquid_hWwMKB": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom_liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What sizes do you offer for bulk floating candles?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"We have two sizes of bulk floating candles: 1.75\\\" x 1\\\" or 3\\\" x 1\\\". They're made to suit any vessel or setting, ensuring you have the right fit for your event's requirements.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"How long do your floating candles burn?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Our floating candles burn from 5 to 8 hours, depending on their size. These extended burn times are perfect for events that go on well into the evening. Specific burn times can be found on our product pages.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What is the minimum order for wholesale floating candles?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Our minimum order requirements are flexible, catering to both small gatherings and large-scale events. Details are available on the product information page. You'll see that the more you order, the more you save.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Do Your Candles Leave Residue in Glass Vases or Bowls?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"No. Our plant-based wax is clean-burning and drip-free, so it won’t leave residue or cloudy buildup on containers. They’re ideal for reuse across multiple events.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Can I Get a Sample Before Placing a Large Order?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Yes. We offer small sample packs for testing purposes. Just contact our support team, and we’ll help you find the right fit before you commit to a full bulk purchase.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What If I Need My Candles Urgently?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"We offer expedited shipping for an additional fee. If you're on a tight timeline for your floating candles bulk purchase, contact our support team, and we’ll do everything we can to accommodate your deadline.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"Do You Ship Floating Candles Bulk Orders Internationally?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"Currently, we only ship within the United States. All domestic orders include free shipping, along with tracking and delivery updates.\"\n    }\n  },{\n    \"@type\": \"Question\",\n    \"name\": \"What’s Your Return Policy for Wholesale Orders?\",\n    \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n      \"text\": \"We offer free returns on all wholesale orders. If you’re not satisfied, simply reach out, and we’ll make it right—no hassles, no restocking fees.\"\n    }\n  }]\n}\n</script>",
        "divider_style": "none",
        "section_padding": "section--vertical-padding-top-bottom"
      }
    },
    "rich_text_p7D8ce": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "spacer_L8mYri": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "heading_MrGjAB": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Frequently Asked Questions About Bulk Floating Candles",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "border_JMAjFR": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_phgQQw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We've answered some common questions about our bulk floating candles below. Please <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/pages/contact-us\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">contact us</span></a> if you'd like more information about these or any of the candles we carry.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_6THxWy": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_jRWLhL": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What sizes do your bulk floating candles come in?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_cVFhCr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We offer bulk floating candles in two main sizes: 1.75\" x 1\" and 3\" x 1\". The smaller size works well for compact bowls and clustered table designs, while the larger size gives you a fuller focal point in wider vessels and more open displays.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_ykeVbb": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_fVaWkq": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What colors are available in your floating candle collection?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_xVMDY7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>White and ivory are our main floating candle colors. These are the shades most customers choose for weddings, receptions, spas, restaurants, and event décor because they pair easily with glass, florals, greenery, and neutral linens.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_68L9WH": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_63Jihh": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "How long do your floating candles burn?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_dttHE3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our floating candles burn for about 5 to 8 hours, depending on the size. That makes them a strong choice for dinners, receptions, and evening events where you want steady candlelight without frequent replacement.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_zbiA3h": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_qWD4dK": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Which floating candle size is best for centerpieces?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_p8DF7h": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Choose the 1.75-inch size for smaller bowls, tighter table layouts, and multi-vessel centerpieces. Choose the 3-inch size when you want the candle to stand out more clearly or when the vessel needs a larger visual anchor.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_kCRbqR": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_3hjEdX": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Do your floating candles leave residue in bowls or vases?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_tg7U8D": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>No. Our floating candles are designed for a clean burn and do not leave cloudy residue or a heavy wax mess in bowls and glass containers. That makes cleanup easier and helps keep reusable vessels looking fresh.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_hBb4xU": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_zEFtrx": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What pack sizes do you offer for bulk floating candles?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_WLE37x": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We offer several pack formats so customers can order for smaller events or larger-scale décor needs. That includes high-count options for the smaller floating candles and medium-size sets for the larger 3-inch format.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_HFcPKi": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_xpCGnV": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Are floating candles a good choice for weddings and special events?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_jpRbxP": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Floating candles are one of the easiest ways to create elegant candlelight in bowls, vases, and water-based centerpieces. They are especially popular for weddings, receptions, spa-style décor, and venues that want a softer, more reflective look.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_N9RXnr": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_cJKMbN": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Can I use bulk floating candles for larger events and keep the look consistent?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_739mUW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Floating candles are a practical option for larger events because you can repeat the same bowl or vase formula across many tables. Sticking with one size and one color usually creates the cleanest and most polished result.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_tVCVXf": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_dkYnaT": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Do you offer wholesale floating candles for planners and repeat buyers?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_GXNwxV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Our floating candles are a strong fit for event planners, venues, stylists, and repeat-use buyers who need dependable candle inventory in larger quantities. Bulk ordering also helps keep the overall look more uniform across the event.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_x4GN8r": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_ENrdkz": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "How do I choose between white and ivory floating candles?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_fDGAFa": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Choose white for a brighter, crisper centerpiece look, and choose ivory for a warmer and softer finish. If your décor includes champagne, cream, blush, or warmer metallics, ivory often blends more naturally into the overall design.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
